  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo Institucional Ambiental</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Institutional Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO SUPPORT ENVIRONMENTAL INSTITUTIONAL DEVELOPMENT IN ARGENTINA AND SET UP THE NATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL SYSTEM. INCLUDES STRENGTHENING THE TECHNICAL AND OPERATING CAPACITY OF THE SECRETARIAT OF NATURAL RESOURCES AND HUMAN ENVIRONMENT AND OTHER ENTITIES AT THE FEDERAL, PROVINCIAL AND MUNICIPAL LEVELS; AND TRAINING AND EDUCATING OF TECHNICAL PERSONNEL. STRENGTHENING OF THE ENVIRONMENTAL INFORMATION SYSTEM THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
